# Allowlist: the build context holds only what the Dockerfile copies.
# Keeps .env and the local .venv out of the build, and anything new out by
# default. A new COPY source must be listed here too, or the build fails.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!alembic.ini
!app/
!alembic/

# Local bytecode; the image compiles its own.
**/__pycache__
